    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36495" root="كأب" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَئِبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاَ^َ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأْبَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَآبَةٌ</span> (S, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأْبٌ</span> (K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأْبَآءُ</span>; (TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكتأب</span></b> ;
(S, K;) <i>He was in an evil state, and broken</i> [<i>in
spirit</i>] <i>by grief,</i> or <i>mourning;</i> (S, K;) <i>he was in
grief, unhappy, sorrowful,</i> or <i>sad.</i> (K.) See
also 4.

